WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:13.631
ate breakfast quickly.

2
00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:18.252
He was very hungry, but he was also in a hurry to see Geppetto.

3
00:00:19.253 --> 00:00:24.974
He thanked the farmer and ran from the house, across the field, and back to the road where

4
00:00:25.014 --> 00:00:26.134
his troubles had started.

5
00:00:28.235 --> 00:00:31.916
As Pinocchio walked, he saw familiar places along the road.

6
00:00:32.724 --> 00:00:36.326
"Look, there is the Field of Follies," he exclaimed.

7
00:00:36.866 --> 00:00:41.108
A few hours later, he said, "Look, that is where I met Mr.

8
00:00:41.188 --> 00:00:42.308
Fox and Mr.

9
00:00:42.388 --> 00:00:45.889
Cat." He tried not to cry about his foolish mistake.

10
00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:54.333
After a few more hours, he said, "Look, that is where I escaped from the marionette master!

11
00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:57.474
Oh, what an adventure I have had.

12
00:00:58.755 --> 00:01:01.336
But it is taking too long to walk home.

13
00:01:02.296 --> 00:01:07.078
I have walked almost all day, and I'm still so far away."

14
00:01:08.779 --> 00:01:11.220
Pinocchio sat on a log and started to cry.

15
00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:14.161
He was tired and he missed Geppetto.

16
00:01:14.961 --> 00:01:21.264
As he cried, he could hear a soft voice calling his name: "Pinocchio Pinocchio."

17
00:01:21.284 --> 00:01:23.325
"I am here!"

18
00:01:23.965 --> 00:01:27.626
Pinocchio shouted, looking around to see who the voice belonged to.

19
00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:32.725
Suddenly, there was a loud whoosh and a lot of feathers.

20
00:01:32.745 --> 00:01:36.348
"Ah, there you are!

21
00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:40.671
I have been looking for you all month," said a handsome eagle.

22
00:01:40.691 --> 00:01:42.993
"You were looking for me?

23
00:01:43.693 --> 00:01:45.254
How did you know my name?"

24
00:01:45.274 --> 00:01:49.958
"Ah, I am an old friend of Geppetto.

25
00:01:50.858 --> 00:01:53.480
He saved me when I was a little egg.

26
00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:58.084
When I heard he had lost his boy, I wanted to help.

27
00:01:58.792 --> 00:02:02.135
So, I have been flying everywhere calling your name.

28
00:02:02.735 --> 00:02:04.737
I am so happy to find you!"

29
00:02:06.578 --> 00:02:08.460
Pinocchio began to jump and dance.

30
00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.582
"You know Geppetto!

31
00:02:11.222 --> 00:02:12.643
Oh, that's wonderful!

32
00:02:13.124 --> 00:02:15.045
I will see my father soon!"

33
00:02:15.065 --> 00:02:19.109
"Well, not as soon as you may think," said the eagle.

34
00:02:19.129 --> 00:02:20.730
"Why not?"

35
00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:22.451
asked Pinocchio, worried.

36
00:02:22.471 --> 00:02:27.956
"When you did not come home from school, Geppetto searched the woods.

37
00:02:28.564 --> 00:02:30.385
Then, he searched the countryside.

38
00:02:31.065 --> 00:02:32.906
Then, he searched all of Italy.

39
00:02:33.766 --> 00:02:39.989
After searching for a month, he has decided to sail to Sicily and Sardinia to find you.

40
00:02:40.629 --> 00:02:43.730
So he built a boat and will sail away today."

41
00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.971
"Oh no!

42
00:02:46.671 --> 00:02:48.772
If only I could get there quickly.

43
00:02:49.713 --> 00:02:53.134
Mr. Eagle, could you please help me find my father?"

44
00:02:53.154 --> 00:02:54.755
"Of course!

45
00:02:55.255 --> 00:02:58.116
I'm happy to help a friend," he answered.

46
00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:03.094
The eagle carefully grabbed Pinocchio with his claws and flew into the sky.

47
00:03:03.814 --> 00:03:08.216
Below him, Pinocchio could see the forest, the countryside, and the sea.

48
00:03:11.377 --> 00:03:16.379
In only a few flaps of the eagle's wings, Pinocchio could see the beach and a crowd of

49
00:03:16.439 --> 00:03:20.181
people. "Please drop me there," he said, pointing.

50
00:03:20.841 --> 00:03:26.783
The eagle carefully set Pinocchio in the sand and flew away, calling, "Good luck, Pinocchio."

51
00:03:26.803 --> 00:03:28.464
"Thank you!"

52
00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.161
Pinocchio called back.

53
00:03:33.122 --> 00:03:35.744
Pinocchio ran through the crowd, looking for Geppetto.

54
00:03:35.764 --> 00:03:38.846
"Excuse me, where is Geppetto?"

55
00:03:39.306 --> 00:03:39.746
he said.

56
00:03:39.766 --> 00:03:41.648
"Who is Geppetto?"

57
00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:43.209
a bystander asked.

58
00:03:43.229 --> 00:03:45.750
"Geppetto is my father.

59
00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:48.892
He has gray hair and a kind smile."

60
00:03:50.133 --> 00:03:51.413
The bystander looked sad.

61
00:03:51.433 --> 00:03:55.256
"Oh, I am terribly sorry, little boy.

62
00:03:56.584 --> 00:03:58.985
Do you see that small boat out there?

63
00:03:59.846 --> 00:04:00.967
That is Geppetto."

64
00:04:01.867 --> 00:04:05.569
Pinocchio looked out at the waves and could see a small brown dot.

65
00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.111
"Oh no!

66
00:04:08.591 --> 00:04:11.353
He is so far away," Pinocchio said.

67
00:04:11.373 --> 00:04:13.774
"Oh, look at the sky!

68
00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:17.356
It is going to rain soon and Father could drown.

69
00:04:17.916 --> 00:04:18.977
I must help him."

70
00:04:20.438 --> 00:04:24.100
Before anyone could stop him, Pinocchio dived into the ocean.

71
00:04:25.377 --> 00:04:28.097
He began the long swim toward Geppetto's boat.
